---
import { BUILD_YEAR, SITE } from '../data/site';
import Glyph from './Glyph.astro';

const elsewhere = [
  { label: 'GitHub', href: SITE.author.github },
  { label: '博客 Notes of Ashen', href: 'https://blog.miku831.fun/' },
  { label: '短链 AshenCourier', href: 'https://shorten.miku831.fun/' },
];
---

<footer class="mt-24 bg-surface">
  <hr class="rule-ember" />
  <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-5xl gap-8 px-5 py-10 sm:grid-cols-[1.4fr_1fr]">
    <div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-primary">
          <Glyph name="sigil" size={22} />
        </span>
        <span class="font-display text-lg text-ink">{SITE.title}</span>
      </div>
      <p class="mt-3 max-w-md text-sm text-muted">
        本站是纯静态页面：没有第三方请求、没有分析脚本、没有 Cookie。字体用系统字体栈，图标是内联
        SVG，打开这一页不会顺带通知别的服务器。
      </p>
    </div>

    <div>
      <p class="label">在别处</p>
      <ul class="mt-3 space-y-2 text-sm">
        {
          elsewhere.map((item) => (
            <li>
              <a
                href={item.href}
                rel="noopener noreferrer"
                class="text-body no-underline hover:text-primary-ink"
              >
                {item.label}
              </a>
            </li>
          ))
        }
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="border-t border-hairline-soft">
    <div
      class="mx-auto flex max-w-5xl flex-wrap items-center gap-x-4 gap-y-1 px-5 py-4 text-xs text-muted-soft"
    >
      <span>© {BUILD_YEAR} {SITE.author.handle}</span>
      <span aria-hidden="true">·</span>
      <span>以 Astro 构建，由 GitHub Actions 发布到 GitHub Pages</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
